<sheet>
<plain>
<text x="304.8" y="27.94" size="2.54" layer="91">CPU and MMU</text>
<text x="27.94" y="160.02" size="1.778" layer="91">Timeshare IOTs:</text>
<text x="66.04" y="195.58" size="1.778" layer="91">CINT = TSIOT &amp; (MA == xxxx1x000100)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="193.04" size="1.778" layer="91">SINT = TSIOT &amp; (MA == xxxx1x101100)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="190.5" size="1.778" layer="91">CUF  = TSIOT &amp; (MA == xxxx1x110100)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="187.96" size="1.778" layer="91">SUF  = TSIOT &amp; (MA == xxxx1x111100)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="185.42" size="1.778" layer="91">GTF  = TSIOT &amp; (MA == xxxx0x000100)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="182.88" size="1.778" layer="91">RTF  = TSIOT &amp; (MA == xxxx0x000101)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="180.34" size="1.778" layer="91">CAF  = TSIOT &amp; (MA == xxxx0x000111)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="177.8" size="1.778" layer="91">NDEVSEL  =   DEVSEL &amp; (MA \!= xxx010101100) # (Inhibits LIF)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="175.26" size="1.778" layer="91">CPDSPD = TSIOT &amp; (MA = xxxx1x11x110)</text>
<text x="27.94" y="213.36" size="1.778" layer="91">IFETCH Event Detect (and latch)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="246.38" size="1.778" layer="91">on rising(XTAFETCH) HLT = (DX == 1111xxxxxx1x0)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="243.84" size="1.778" layer="91">on rising(XTAFETCH) OSR= (DX == 1111xxxxxxx10)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="241.3" size="1.778" layer="91">on rising(XTAFETCH) IOT =  (DX == 1110xxxxxxxxx)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="233.68" size="1.778" layer="91">FNOP= PRV &amp; (HLT | OSR | IOT)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="236.22" size="1.778" layer="91">on rising(XTAFETCH) IBIF = (DX == 10xxxxxxxxxx)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="248.92" size="1.778" layer="91">XTAFETCH = XTA &amp; IFETCH</text>
<text x="66.04" y="172.72" size="1.778" layer="91">TSIOT = XTA &amp; DEVSEL &amp; IOT &amp; (MA == xxx0x0xxx1xx)</text>
<text x="66.04" y="238.76" size="1.778" layer="91">on rising(XTAFETCH) PRV = UF &amp; CPSEL\\</text>
<text x="27.94" y="210.82" size="1.778" layer="91">FNOP inhibited when fetching CP memory.</text>
<text x="25.4" y="10.16" size="1.778" layer="91">MA Latches</text>
<text x="27.94" y="127" size="1.778" layer="91">User Mode</text>
<text x="22.86" y="93.98" size="1.778" layer="91">CP MMU Support</text>
<text x="127" y="119.38" size="1.778" layer="91">IOT and OSR Inhibit</text>
<text x="198.12" y="127" size="1.778" layer="91">HLT Inhibit</text>
<text x="177.8" y="88.9" size="1.778" layer="91">Generate timeshare interrupt request.</text>
<text x="177.8" y="91.44" size="1.778" layer="91">Allow non-bus skip/int requests.</text>
<text x="177.8" y="83.82" size="1.778" layer="91">Implement CINT</text>
<text x="177.8" y="81.28" size="1.778" layer="91">Implement SINT</text>
<text x="177.8" y="78.74" size="1.778" layer="91">Implement GTF</text>
<text x="177.8" y="76.2" size="1.778" layer="91">Implement RTF</text>
<text x="177.8" y="73.66" size="1.778" layer="91">Implement CAF</text>
<text x="177.8" y="60.96" size="1.778" layer="91">Implement Memory</text>
<text x="177.8" y="58.42" size="1.778" layer="91">Implement Memory Bank disable</text>
<text x="177.8" y="68.58" size="1.778" layer="91">Implement PDF support.</text>
<text x="86.36" y="68.58" size="1.778" layer="91">HLT Inhibit (resume)</text>
<text x="88.9" y="93.98" size="1.778" layer="91">User Mode Trap</text>
</plain>
